<section class="bf-blk" id="faq" aria-labelledby="h-faq"><div class="bf-in">
 <div class="bf-head"><h2 id="h-faq">Questions people ask before buying</h2></div>
 <div class="bf-faq">
  <details open><summary>Will it arrive in time?</summary><p>Infrared saunas ship within a few business days and usually arrive in 7 to 10 days. Traditional sauna lead times vary by model and are listed on each product page. Buying as a gift or not ready yet? We can hold your sauna until you are. <a href="https://www.salussaunas.com/blogs/blog/sauna-delivery-installation-timeline">Delivery and installation timeline</a></p></details>
  <details><summary>How does shipping work?</summary><p>Free curbside freight shipping to the mainland US, wherever a 53-foot truck can reach. Cabin and hybrid saunas ship flatbed and get a shipping quote. White glove delivery is available on request. <a href="https://www.salussaunas.com/policies/shipping-policy">Shipping policy</a></p></details>
  <details><summary>Can I pay over time?</summary><p>Yes. Choose Affirm at checkout, or call us at (888) 287-0111 to apply with Synchrony, starting at 0% APR over 18 months. <a href="https://www.salussaunas.com/pages/sauna-financing">Financing options</a></p></details>
  <details><summary>Will I need an electrician?</summary><p>It depends on the model and its heater. Each product page lists the requirements in its Electrical tab, and our guide explains the options: <a href="https://www.salussaunas.com/blogs/blog/electrical-requirements-for-infrared-and-traditional-saunas">electrical requirements</a>.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What's the warranty?</summary><p>Traditional and hybrid saunas: 5 years on the wood, the heater and the controls. Infrared saunas: coverage is listed on each product page. <a href="https://www.salussaunas.com/pages/sauna-warranty">Warranty details</a></p></details>
  <details><summary>Can I assemble it myself?</summary><p>Most customers do, with two people. Infrared saunas go together in a few hours; the largest outdoor models can take a weekend. Each product page lists the time.</p></details>
 </div>
</div></section>

